+// ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
+// `CAW-3` · THE GUARD'S BOUND AT THE LATER ARMS — A CALLER'S FILE IS NEVER TOUCHED (GREEN BEFORE AND AFTER)
